<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">24082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Not even one drop of oil will leave the Strait of Hormuz, Iran's Mohsen Rezaei warned, hours before Washington was due to publish the detail of new sanctions.</s> <s>Roughly a fifth of the world's seaborne crude passes through that channel, and the buyers who'd absorb a closure are in Jakarta, Delhi and Beijing... not in the treasury writing the sanction.</s> <s>Markets barely moved, which tells you either that traders think it's a bluff, or that they've stopped pricing threats they've heard before.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Britain will let the European manufacturer <sub alias="M B D A">MBDA</sub> share long-range missile production data with France and Ukraine, moving Kyiv from a recipient of finished weapons to a co-producer of them.</s> <s>That's a bigger shift than any single transfer, because since twenty twenty-two every deep-strike decision has run through a political veto exercised shipment by shipment, and a production line removes it.</s> <s>Weapons deliveries can be switched off; a factory can't be unbuilt... though inside a war zone it can certainly be bombed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi artillery shelled farming villages in the Razih district of Saada province in northern Yemen on Monday.</s> <s>Cross-border bombardment of this strip has continued on and off for eleven years, through the truce years and past every announced end to the war, striking villages with no air defence and nowhere to evacuate to.</s> <s>The only account of it in today's global feed comes from Iranian state media relaying a Houthi-aligned broadcaster, and that absence of any other witness is the second half of the story.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At least thirty people were killed in Conakry when a mountain of uncollected waste collapsed onto the shacks built at its base after a night of rain.</s> <s>Guinea's capital of some two million people has never had an engineered landfill, so the dump grew uncompacted and undrained until gravity finished the argument, exactly as it did at Ethiopia's Koshe dump in twenty seventeen and at Payatas in Manila before that.</s> <s>Those who died were waste-pickers who lived there because that's where their income was, and the site had been scheduled to close that very day.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gunmen seized worshippers from a mosque in New Bussa during Friday prayers, and Niger State's government answered two days later with a statement.</s> <s>Nigeria's constitution gives states no police force of their own, so a governor facing an abduction can appeal to Abuja and little else, while the federal government alone commands the armed forces.</s> <s>Security forces haven't said how many people were taken... which in Nigeria's north-west has become the most reliable indicator that nobody is counting.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uzbekistan and Azerbaijan set a one billion dollar trade target for twenty thirty and tied it to the Trans-Caspian freight route.</s> <s>Read that as a map rather than a summit: two Central Asian and Caucasian states are building an east-west line to Europe that crosses neither Russia nor Iran, which is precisely why it's worth its higher cost per container.</s> <s>The ceiling isn't political will but steel and concrete — ferry berths and port capacity at Alat and Aktau decide how much of that ambition ever floats.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Shein is raising up to one point seven seven billion dollars in Hong Kong on the first of September, on the same day its purchase of the American brand Everlane entered a national security review in Washington.</s> <s>One company, two verdicts: welcomed as capital in one financial centre, screened as a risk in the other, because what a fast-fashion firm actually owns is shopper data and logistics rather than clothes.</s> <s>Neither the listing prospectus nor the security review takes up the question that's followed the company since twenty twenty-one, which is who sews the garments and under what terms.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's commerce minister Piyush Goyal landed in Tokyo with a delegation of nearly two hundred companies.</s> <s>Behind it sits a Japanese pledge of ten trillion yen of investment in India over a decade, a state-to-state number that has so far produced far fewer factories than headlines, and the delegation is an attempt to convert one into the other.</s> <s>Semiconductors explain the itinerary — Japan holds the photoresists, wafers and lithography components India's new fabs can't source at scale anywhere else, and that, not money, is the bottleneck.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada has promised dollar-for-dollar retaliation after new American tariffs of fifty percent took effect on Saturday under a Depression-era law, taxing vehicles at every border crossing.</s> <s>Retaliation is an act of self-harm when seventy percent of your exports go to the country you're retaliating against, and Ottawa knows it — the automotive supply chain crosses that border several times before a single car is finished.</s> <s>What's being tested isn't the tariff schedule but whether a smaller economy can make defiance cost the larger one enough to matter.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia launched a Soyuz rocket from Plesetsk on Monday carrying a payload its defence ministry described only as serving the ministry's interests.</s> <s>Silence like that is itself information: Plesetsk is the military cosmodrome, its steep orbits suit reconnaissance and early warning, and unnamed payloads get filed under a Kosmos number precisely so nobody can infer what they do.</s> <s>Orbits, though, are public even when payloads aren't, and amateur trackers will have the inclination and period within days.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers on Turkey's Lycian coast have reconstructed the mortar of the Roman harbour city of Phaselis, and it's still standing in salt spray after two thousand years.</s> <s>The secret is crushed fired brick, whose clay reacts with lime to set hydraulically without the fourteen-hundred-degree kiln that makes modern cement responsible for something like eight percent of global carbon emissions.</s> <s>Conservators who are legally barred from putting cement on heritage sites now have a binder that takes demolition rubble as an ingredient rather than a disposal problem.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Biologists in Barcelona compared four thousand proteins shared by humans and mice, and found that human proteins simply break down more slowly.</s> <s>It's a consistent species-wide offset rather than a handful of outliers, and it offers the first molecular explanation for why a human embryo takes so much longer to build than a mouse embryo of the same complexity.</s> <s>Whether that difference is the clock itself, or merely something the clock winds, is the question the work leaves open.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Lahore's traffic chief has proposed that unpaid camera fines block a driver's national identity card, passport and vehicle sale.</s> <s>Consider what a blocked <sub alias="C N I C">CNIC</sub> means in Pakistan, where the same number governs your bank account, your phone line and your right to travel — an automated two-thousand-rupee ticket becomes a suspension of documented life.</s> <s>Enforcement by database join inverts the burden of proof, and once identity records work as a debt-collection tool, the next department will ask to borrow them too.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Engineers have built a flapping-wing robot that generates fifty-seven point two grams of lift at eight beats per second by making both wings clap at the top of the stroke.</s> <s>Hummingbirds and insects get that bonus for free, but a machine only gets it if the two wings arrive within a few milliseconds of one another, so the real achievement here is phase control rather than aerodynamics.</s> <s>Machines like this fly where rotors can't — inside collapsed buildings, beneath forest canopy — and they also make a surveillance drone the size of a sparrow.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study tested five image-scoring models on Indian and Indonesian heritage collections, and found they judge harshly what they were never trained to see.</s> <s>Aesthetic models learn beauty from Western photography benchmarks, then get pointed at manuscripts and temple art whose whole visual grammar sits outside that training distribution.</s> <s>Museums and archives use exactly these scores to decide what gets digitised first, so a machine's foreign taste quietly sends a manuscript to the back of the queue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Usage data suggest the most capable model on the market is losing customers to cheaper rivals.</s> <s>Benchmark leadership and commercial adoption have come apart, because for most production work a model at a fraction of the token price crossed the required quality threshold some time ago, and buyers noticed before the vendors did.</s> <s>Inference is turning into a utility faster than the training bills can be paid off, and it's the open-weight and low-cost providers absorbing the volume.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>